<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Your progress · Prepto</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheet/product.css"><script defer src="/productCommon.js"></script><script defer src="/progressProduct.js"></script></head><body class="product"><%- include('partials/productNav') %><main><p class="eyebrow">A little better every session</p><h1>See how far you have come.</h1><p class="subtle">Review your practice, compare your recent scores and choose the next skill to strengthen.</p><div class="row"><button id="refresh-progress" class="secondary">Refresh progress</button><a href="/interviews" class="button">Start practice</a><a href="/progress/legacy">Original dashboard</a></div><div id="status" class="state" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading progress…</div><p id="window-note" class="subtle"></p><section id="metrics" class="grid" aria-label="Practice summary"></section><section><h2>Skill trends</h2><p class="subtle">Within the latest 200 attempts per type/category, your scored attempts by skill, with sample counts and change from the previous attempt.</p><div id="skills" class="grid"></div></section><section><h2>Compare your attempts</h2><p class="subtle">Latest vs previous normalized score, grouped by interview type.</p><div id="comparisons" class="grid"></div></section><section><h2>Your next study steps</h2><div id="recommendations" class="grid"></div></section><section><h2>Personal study goals</h2><div id="goals" class="grid"></div><form id="goal-form" class="toolbar"><label>Skill<input name="skill" list="known-skills" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Node.js" required><datalist id="known-skills"></datalist></label><label>Target score (%)<input name="targetScore" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="80" required></label><label>Sessions in 7 days<input name="weeklySessions" type="number" min="1" max="14" value="2" required></label><button type="submit">Save goal</button><p id="goal-error" role="alert"></p></form></section><section><h2>Attempt history</h2><div class="toolbar"><label>Interview type<select id="history-type"><option value="">All attempts</option><% types.forEach(type => { %><option value="<%= type %>"><%= type %></option><% }) %></select></label></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Practice</th><th>Score</th><th>Review</th></tr></thead><tbody id="history"></tbody></table></div><p id="history-empty" class="subtle" hidden>No attempts in this view yet.</p><button id="more-history" class="secondary" hidden>Load older attempts</button></section></main></body></html>
